WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:06.874
Ringo and Bot zoomed across the desert.

2
00:00:06.875 --> 00:00:10.211
The moon root floated above them.

3
00:00:10.212 --> 00:00:15.698
"I hope the bunny sees this!" Ringo said.

4
00:00:15.699 --> 00:00:18.804
The bunny chased the rover.

5
00:00:18.805 --> 00:00:30.696
Boom! Boom!

6
00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:37.802
Suddenly the bunny stopped.

7
00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:41.522
"It sees the moon root!" Bot said.

8
00:00:41.523 --> 00:00:45.445
"It's hopping this way!"

9
00:00:45.446 --> 00:00:49.458
"Whew. Spark's safe," Ringo said.

10
00:00:49.459 --> 00:00:53.521
"But we're not!" Bot said.

11
00:00:53.522 --> 00:00:55.885
Boom! Boom!

12
00:00:55.886 --> 00:00:58.460
The bunny was hopping fast.

13
00:00:58.461 --> 00:01:13.614
"Get to the rover!" Ringo cried.

14
00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:24.935
Ringo and Bot sped to the rover.

15
00:01:24.936 --> 00:01:27.048
They got in.

16
00:01:27.049 --> 00:01:31.000
"Drive, Spark! Drive!" Ringo said.

17
00:01:31.001 --> 00:01:33.351
The rover went fast.

18
00:01:33.352 --> 00:01:39.192
The bunny hopped behind it. Boom! Boom!

19
00:01:39.193 --> 00:01:43.286
"Drive faster, Spark!" Ringo shouted.

20
00:01:43.287 --> 00:01:47.863
"I can't!" Spark said. "Look!"

21
00:01:47.864 --> 00:01:50.877
Ringo saw a big ditch up ahead.

22
00:01:50.878 --> 00:01:57.711
Spark was crying. "Space Patrol is scary!"

23
00:01:57.712 --> 00:02:01.505
The bunny was right behind the rover.

24
00:02:01.506 --> 00:02:03.862
Ringo grabbed the steering wheel.

25
00:02:03.863 --> 00:02:08.026
Screech! The rover turned left.

26
00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:15.820
The bunny hopped over the edge.

27
00:02:15.821 --> 00:02:19.526
"That was close!" Ringo said.

28
00:02:19.527 --> 00:02:22.075
Bot looked into the ditch.

29
00:02:22.076 --> 00:02:25.640
"I see more bunnies!" she said.

30
00:02:25.641 --> 00:02:29.856
"They're eating moon roots."

31
00:02:29.857 --> 00:02:34.642
"Whew. We're all safe," Ringo said.

32
00:02:34.643 --> 00:02:39.478
Spark shook his head and cried.

33
00:02:39.479 --> 00:02:46.512
"I want to go home!"

